--
-- Generated, not typed: the supplier's 634 documented packages (docs.esimaccess.com
-- Postman examples) run through lib/esim/providers/esimaccess.ts mapPackage(),
-- lib/esim/catalogue.ts planRowFor() and lib/esim/curate.ts curateDestination()
-- — the same code the live /admin/esim sync runs. Only the 43 plans a shelf
-- uses are seeded; the owner's first sync brings the full catalogue and
-- re-curates every destination the owner has not edited by hand.
